                            <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">优（2-4小时不起雾）</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;">保暖性</td>
                            <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">差（冷风直吹眼睛）</td>
